unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: var(--sdi-color);">SD-Int.</span> — Party leader, writer, and public intellectual.<ul>Overall skill: ★★★★<br>Suitability: ★☆</ul>[?if coalition_government != 1 : We haven't assented to SD-Internationalist participation in government. ?][?if education_minister = "Sukhanov": Sukhanov already has a post. ?][?if sdi_relation < 40 : <br> Sukhanov won't accept this offer. ?]
tags: property_candidates
